<h2>Where should the filters go on the account activity page?</h2>
<p class="subtitle">Filters: event type (checkboxes for the 9 real types) and a date range (from, to, plus presets). Wireframes only; spacing and colors will come from the guideline tokens.</p>

<div class="options">
  <div class="option" data-choice="a" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">A</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Filter panel above the table, always open</h3>
      <p>Everything is visible at once, with no extra click. It pushes the table down by about the panel's height.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p style="margin:0 0 .5rem">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
          <div style="border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:8px;padding:.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <fieldset style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0">
              <legend style="font-weight:500">Event type</legend>
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,auto);gap:.25rem 1rem;font-size:.85rem">
                <label>&#9744; Sign-in</label><label>&#9745; Sign-in failed</label><label>&#9744; Sign-out</label>
                <label>&#9744; Session expired</label><label>&#9745; Password changed</label><label>&#9745; Two-factor enabled</label>
                <label>&#9745; Email change requested</label><label>&#9744; Settings updated</label><label>&#9744; API token used</label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:500">Date range</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:end;font-size:.85rem">
                <label>From<br><input class="mock-input" style="width:7rem" value="Sep 21, 2026"></label>
                <label>To<br><input class="mock-input" style="width:7rem" value="Sep 27, 2026"></label>
                <label>Presets<br><input class="mock-input" style="width:7rem" value="Custom &#9662;"></label>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p style="margin:.5rem 0;font-size:.85rem">Showing 9 of 48 events &middot; <u>Clear filters</u></p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="option" data-choice="b" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">B</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>"Filter" button with a popover, active filters shown as tags</h3>
      <p>Keeps the table near the top. Changing a filter takes an extra click, and the popover needs focus handling.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p style="margin:0 0 .5rem">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.85rem">
            <button class="mock-button">Filter &#9662;</button>
            <span style="border:1px solid #999;border-radius:999px;padding:0 .5rem">Sign-in failed &times;</span>
            <span style="border:1px solid #999;border-radius:999px;padding:0 .5rem">Password changed &times;</span>
            <span style="border:1px solid #999;border-radius:999px;padding:0 .5rem">+2 more</span>
            <span style="border:1px solid #999;border-radius:999px;padding:0 .5rem">Sep 21 to Sep 27 &times;</span>
          </div>
          <div style="position:relative">
            <div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:.25rem;width:16rem;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:8px;padding:.5rem;background:#fff;font-size:.8rem;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.15);z-index:1">
              Popover: event type checkboxes, then From / To / Presets
            </div>
          </div>
          <p style="margin:.5rem 0;font-size:.85rem">Showing 9 of 48 events</p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="option" data-choice="c" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">C</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Sidebar to the left of the table</h3>
      <p>Filters stay visible while scrolling. The six-column table loses about a quarter of its width, and at narrow widths the sidebar has to stack above the table anyway.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body" style="display:flex;gap:.75rem">
          <div class="mock-sidebar" style="min-width:9rem;font-size:.8rem">Event type<br>&#9744; Sign-in<br>&#9745; Sign-in failed<br>&hellip; 7 more<br><br>Date range<br>From / To<br>Presets</div>
          <div style="flex:1">
            <p style="margin:0 0 .5rem;font-size:.85rem">Showing 9 of 48 events</p>
            <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
